{"run_id": "run_63d1ce62d9e9", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_014", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s14_human_transfer_complaint", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "方便，你说吧。不过你们这个平台发票功能老是变来变去，很烦人。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "非常理解您的心情，这次更新是为了优化开票流程，新版入口更便捷。具体您可以登录商家后台，在“财务管理”模块找到“发票管理”入口。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "每次更新都说是优化，但实际用起来问题一堆。上次更新后我找开票入口找了半天，这次又改，你们能不能考虑下商家的使用体验？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "您说得对，我们确实在努力改进。如果您后续遇到任何问题，可以查看帮助中心的相关指引，或者我们也可以为您预约一次回访，由专人指导操作。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "算了，我不想听这些，你们直接给我转人工客服吧，我要投诉。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我马上为您转接人工客服，请稍候。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "嗯，快点。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "tool_name": "transfer_to_human", "arguments": {}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "transferred", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
